{"title":"Is there now a better trend in youth mental health?","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/968950481/0/marginalrevolution~Is-there-now-a-better-trend-in-youth-mental-health.html","date":1789101285000,"content":"<blockquote><p>A key U.S. government report on mental health, substance use and addiction showed continued improvements in several metrics, especially among young people.</p>\r\n<p>There was some uncertainty about the future of the National Survey on Drug Use and Health last year, when the entire 17-member team responsible for it was <span><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://apnews.com/article/health-human-services-layoffs-restructuring-rfk-jr-ec4d7731695e4204970c7eab953b2289\">laid off</a></span> by the Trump administration. But the Substance Abuse and Mental Health Services Administration released the latest report Monday, with data that lets researchers look at trends from 2021 to 2025.</p>\r\n<p>Fewer adolescents aged 12 to 17 reported using tobacco, alcohol, marijuana and binge drinking in the previous month, the survey found.</p>\r\n<p>And in the past year, fewer in that age group reported:</p>\r\n<p>— illicit drug and marijuana use</p>\r\n<p>— starting drinking alcohol, vaping or marijuana</p>\r\n<p>— substance, alcohol or drug use disorders</p>\r\n<p>Adolescents also saw declining trends for major depressive episodes and fewer reported serious thoughts of suicide, making a suicide plan and attempting suicide.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>Here is <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://apnews.com/article/mental-health-addiction-drugs-19d7638073fe40c7f36766b97e826349\" target=\"_blank\">the link</a>, via <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://x.com/CJFerguson1111/status/2096223073460421092\" target=\"_blank\">Chris Ferguson</a>.</p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/09/is-there-now-a-better-trend-in-youth-mental-health.html\">Is there now a better trend in youth mental health?</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/968950481/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/968950481/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/968950481/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/968950481/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/x.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/19/968950481/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/email20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/20/968950481/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/rss20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/09/is-there-now-a-better-trend-in-youth-mental-health.html#comments\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/comments20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/09/is-there-now-a-better-trend-in-youth-mental-health.html/feed\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/commentsrss20.png\" /></a> \r\n<div><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/09/is-there-now-a-better-trend-in-youth-mental-health.html#comments\"><h3>Comments</h3></a><ul><li><a href=\"https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/09/is-there-now-a-better-trend-in-youth-mental-health.html#comment-161074816\">In reply to Community College Prof.   Ha, yeah, if you don't ...</a> <i>by Wayfaring Stranger</i></l